{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1018268-splitting-dice-and-shifting","id":1018268,"title":"Splitting dice and shifting?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-16T17:13:12-08:00","id":1018268,"title":"Splitting dice and shifting?","content":"In the cWoD community I play on, a friend of mine asked me this. I'm a D:tF person myself so I'm pretty clueless about it. <br /> <br /> Can werewolves split their dice in order to shift into their changing forms while doing another action?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12205-xero_asura","name":"Xero_Asura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12205_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-16T23:12:49-08:00","id":1018357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xero_Asura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1018268-splitting-dice-and-shifting#post1018268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the cWoD community I play on, a friend of mine asked me this. I'm a D:tF person myself so I'm pretty clueless about it.<br /> <br /> Can werewolves split their dice in order to shift into their changing forms while doing another action?</div> </div> </div> </div>There isn't any reason they shouldn't be able to shift with a partial dice pool. Keep in mind though that additional successes are needed to move through multiple forms, so using a smaller dice pool will possibly bite you in the ass (Homid to Crinos requires 2 successes, Homid to Lupus is 4).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T01:06:53-08:00","id":1018373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1018268-splitting-dice-and-shifting?p=1018357#post1018357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There isn't any reason they shouldn't be able to shift with a partial dice pool. Keep in mind though that additional successes are needed to move through multiple forms, so using a smaller dice pool will possibly bite you in the ass (Homid to Crinos requires 2 successes, Homid to Lupus is 4).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for clearing that up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12205-xero_asura","name":"Xero_Asura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12205_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T02:55:31-08:00","id":1018392,"title":"","content":"In some of the older books, the phrasing was a bit different and can be interpreted to mean you can't split with shifting, but W20's phrasing lacks any of that. So if someone is assuming they can't it might be an artifact of old rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}